First, notice that by Vieta's formulas,
\begin{align*}
r + s + t &= 0, \\
rs + st + tr &= 1001/8, \\
rst &= -251.
\end{align*}

We can then compute
\begin{align*}
(r + s)^3 + (s + t)^3 + (t + r)^3
&= 3(r + s + t)(rs + st + tr) - 3rst \\
&= 3(0)(1001/8) - 3(-251) \\
&= \boxed{753.}
\end{align*}

